<mxCell id="c4_c44" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#6c8ebf'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; módulo de domínio (pacote de topo) &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#999999'&gt;▢&lt;/span&gt; módulo sem dependências&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#9673a6'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; guard partilhado &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#d6b656'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; serviço partilhado &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#d79b00'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; filtro / handler transversal&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#b85450'&gt;&lt;b&gt;- - ▶◀&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt; ciclo direto entre módulos (ADR-0002 C1–C9 + novos) — &lt;b&gt;todos ainda presentes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#9673a6'&gt;──▶&lt;/span&gt; / &lt;span style='color:#b08600'&gt;──▶&lt;/span&gt; uso de guard / serviço partilhado&lt;br&gt;Spring Modulith ainda &lt;b&gt;não&lt;/b&gt; está no pom.xml (ADR-0002 aceite, incremento “Modulith baseline” por fazer)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1520" width="620" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c4_c45" value="&lt;b&gt;Matriz de dependências diretas entre módulos&lt;/b&gt; (import com.delivery.&amp;lt;módulo&amp;gt;; vermelho = parte de ciclo)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;auth&lt;/b&gt; → &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;tenant&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;vendor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;cart&lt;/b&gt; → auth, catalog, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;geo&lt;/b&gt;, inventory, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;marketing&lt;/b&gt;, tenant, vendor&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;catalog&lt;/b&gt; → &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;inventory&lt;/b&gt;, upload, vendor&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;customer&lt;/b&gt; → auth, geo&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;dashboard&lt;/b&gt; → auth, delivery, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;dispatch&lt;/b&gt;, finance, order, payment, vendor&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;delivery&lt;/b&gt; → auth, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;dispatch&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;dispatch&lt;/b&gt; → auth, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;dashboard&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;delivery&lt;/b&gt;, order&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;finance&lt;/b&gt; → payment&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;geo&lt;/b&gt; → &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;cart&lt;/b&gt;, catalog, vendor&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;inventory&lt;/b&gt; → &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;catalog&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="1520" width="860" height="164" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c4_c46" value="&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;marketing&lt;/b&gt; → &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;cart&lt;/b&gt;, catalog, order, vendor&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;notification&lt;/b&gt; → auth&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;order&lt;/b&gt; → auth, cart, catalog, customer, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;delivery&lt;/b&gt;, inventory, notification, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;payment&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;sales&lt;/b&gt;, vendor&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;payment&lt;/b&gt; → auth, delivery, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;order&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;report&lt;/b&gt; → vendor&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;sales&lt;/b&gt; → auth, catalog, delivery, finance, notification, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;order&lt;/b&gt;, payment, vendor&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;tenant&lt;/b&gt; → &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;auth&lt;/b&gt;, dispatch, geo, vendor&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;vendor&lt;/b&gt; → &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;auth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;common&lt;/b&gt; → &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;auth&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b style='color:#b85450'&gt;tenant&lt;/b&gt; (TenantRequestFilter / TenancyWebConfig)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;rating, support&lt;/b&gt; → (nenhum) · &lt;b&gt;todos&lt;/b&gt; → common" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="1520" width="880" height="164" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
</mxfile>
